### Additional context

I've tried the [`minSize` option](https://rolldown.rs/reference/OutputOptions.codeSplitting#minsize), and it doesn't have any effect on any value. I am getting over 600 chunks on Vite v8.0.1 instead of 300 on Vite v7.3.1.

